+--!strict
+-- The wispbride's dress (a gown set for the fen): a fitted mist-grey bodice
+-- over a willow front panel and pale stomacher, a black-water sash and a
+-- wisp-blue ribbon drawing in the waist. The skirt hangs from the thighs in
+-- pale panels with willow strand lines and flares to the knee; behind, a
+-- bustle and a cold blue bow, and wisp-glass lanterns at either hip.
